<title>USA: TABLE- ALLSTATE FINANCIAL Q2 PROFIT VS LOSS.</title>
<headline>TABLE- ALLSTATE FINANCIAL Q2 PROFIT VS LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.12     loss	 $0.85</p>
<p> Net	profit	    273     loss	 1,980</p>
<p> Revs			 2,082		    3,286</p>
<p> Avg			  2,318		    2,317</p>
<p>Six months  Shr     profit	   $0.23     loss	 $0.75</p>
<p> Net     profit	     531     loss	 1,756</p>
<p> Revs			 4,814		    6,171</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,318		    2,339</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Allstate Financial Corp said 1996 earnings were adversely affected by write-offs or write-downs of certain non-performing assets.</p>
